<%--
_Sys_Sites_Action - the Sites screen: every tenant on the install in one grid
(_Sys_Sites_DataGrid, grid key "sites"). A row opens the site (_Sys_Site_View_Action),
where it is renamed, enabled or disabled. There is no delete.
--%>
<Define:_Sys_Sites_Action>
<_Sys_Page_Scaffold>
    <Slot:main>
        <_Sys_Sites_DataGrid />
    </Slot:main>
</_Sys_Page_Scaffold>
</Define:_Sys_Sites_Action>
